### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 88/100.** Evidence Terminal-Bench 2.1: 82.7%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 88/100.** Evidence HLE 57.9% with tools; GPQA 86% lineage; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 70/100.** 200K — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 60/100.** Text, image in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 88/100.** Evidence SWE-bench Pro 69.2%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 55/100.** Paid $5/$25 per 1M (200K context).
- **Overall Score: 79/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (88+88+70+60+88)/5=78.8 → 79; best-fit per scoring methodology.

